+0.3.0 (2026-10-14)
+------------------
+* BUILD CHANGE: polkit is now required. The -Dpolkit option is gone;
+  remove it from any meson setup command line or packaging script.
+* Hostname validation is stricter (RFC 1123): labels over 63
+  characters, empty labels such as "a..b", and labels beginning or
+  ending with "-" are now rejected.
+* GetProductUUID now returns 16 raw bytes like systemd-hostnamed
+  (it previously returned the 36 ASCII characters of the textual
+  UUID). Clients that parsed the old form must be updated. It now
+  returns an error instead of an empty array when no UUID exists.
+* Fixed spurious PropertiesChanged signals for Chassis and IconName
+  on every file change.
+* IconName is derived from the effective chassis, so a CHASSIS value
+  in /etc/machine-info now selects the matching icon.
+* DefaultHostname is now populated and HostnameSource can report
+  "default".
+* SetPrettyHostname only shortens a value to its first label when the
+  value is a valid hostname; free-form labels containing dots are
+  kept intact.
+* Hardware information falls back to the device tree on systems
+  without DMI (HardwareModel, HardwareVendor, Chassis).
+* HardwareVendor and HardwareModel now skip empty and placeholder
+  DMI strings ("System manufacturer", "System Product Name", "To Be
+  Filled By O.E.M.", ...) and fall back from sys_vendor/product_name
+  to board_vendor/board_name, so desktop boards that only fill in
+  the baseboard record report their real vendor and model.
+* GetHardwareSerial returns the first usable of product_serial,
+  board_serial and chassis_serial instead of chassis_serial only,
+  skipping placeholder values such as "Default string" and
+  "System Serial Number". On systems without DMI it falls back to
+  the device-tree serial-number property.
+* Chassis detection recognises server, embedded and mini-PC
+  SMBIOS types; slack/hostnamectl uses the same table.
+* Authorization that needs interactive authentication now fails with
+  org.freedesktop.DBus.Error.InteractiveAuthorizationRequired so
+  clients can retry with interactive=true.
 
